{"title":"2017 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Richard_Rusczyk\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Richard Rusczyk</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is constructed as follows. To begin, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df745ef918affeb99f94fa199a4dee661a68f08b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\{0,10\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" />. Repeatedly, as long as possible, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer root of some polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82dfec03e116b484e8e8f33f3af5cabad4c70e18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n}x^n + a_{n-1}x^{n-1} + \\dots + a_{1}x + a_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"263\" height=\"17\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/a/6aaaca534ced32c0f4d583e9626459a21f489941.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\geq{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, all of whose coefficients <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> are elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is put into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. When no more elements can be added to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, how many elements does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> have?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/c/becd654280dcfeb340406a63fedc84f165957b55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At first, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/5/b05d833d2b2ec928bdfe952d9d51ff8bff9bb1d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=\\{0,10\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/3/0a3bc1888e104b19e3152897edf1b88fd3842a28.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{r c l c l} \\(10x+10\\) &amp; has root &amp; \\(x=-1\\) &amp; so now &amp; \\(S=\\{-1,0,10\\}\\) \\\\ \\(-x^{10}-x^9-x^8-x^7-x^6-x^5-x^4-x^3-x^2-x+10\\) &amp; has root &amp; \\(x=1\\) &amp; so now &amp; \\(S=\\{-1,0,1,10\\}\\) \\\\ \\(x+10\\) &amp; has root &amp; \\(x=-10\\) &amp; so now &amp; \\(S=\\{-10,-1,0,1,10\\}\\) \\\\ \\(x^3+x-10\\) &amp; has root &amp; \\(x=2\\) &amp; so now &amp; \\(S=\\{-10,-1,0,1,2,10\\}\\) \\\\ \\(x+2\\) &amp; has root &amp; \\(x=-2\\) &amp; so now &amp; \\(S=\\{-10,-2,-1,0,1,2,10\\}\\) \\\\ \\(2x-10\\) &amp; has root &amp; \\(x=5\\) &amp; so now &amp; \\(S=\\{-10,-2,-1,0,1,2,5,10\\}\\) \\\\ \\(x+5\\) &amp; has root &amp; \\(x=-5\\) &amp; so now &amp; \\(S=\\{-10,-5,-2,-1,0,1,2,5,10\\}\\) \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"961\" height=\"138\" />\n</p><p>At this point, no more elements can be added to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. To see this, let\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/6/de65a5ecdb21fdb5846fa4fbcb7313835e7898a9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a_{n}x^n + a_{n-1}x^{n-1} + ... + a_{2}x^2 + a_{1}x + a_0 &amp;= 0 \\\\ x(a_{n}x^{n-1} + a_{n-1}x^{n-2} + ... + a_{2}x + a_{1}) + a_0 &amp;= 0 \\\\ x(a_{n}x^{n-1} + a_{n-1}x^{n-2} + ... + a_{2}x + a_{1}) &amp;= -a_0 \\end{align*}\" width=\"392\" height=\"75\" />\n</p><p>with each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee5c7c921b3334f6ecf58c241eeea42acf0ce71e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee5c7c921b3334f6ecf58c241eeea42acf0ce71e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> is in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> has to be a factor of some element in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />. There are no such integers left, so there can be no additional elements. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/bef045639aa7cd47704534dfc2589b251b715b2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{-10,-5,-2,-1,0,1,2,5,10\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"238\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> elements <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c7e62aa15e0993abbccb54c86019990ff186c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\to \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Richard_Rusczyk\">Video Solution by Richard Rusczyk</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Richard Rusczyk\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hSYSNBVPLhE&amp;list=PLyhPcpM8aMvLZmuDnM-0vrFniLpo7Orbp&amp;index=1\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hSYSNBVPLhE&amp;list=PLyhPcpM8aMvLZmuDnM-0vrFniLpo7Orbp&amp;index=1</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A\" title=\"2017 AMC 12A\">2017 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"